          "guid": "mt2nrzp4u5e4cbba",
          "message": {
            "text": "inset:0; margin:auto is required on the native <dialog> because the app reset (* { margin: 0 }, _base.scss) zeroes the UA margin: auto that centers a modal dialog. Without it the dialog parked at the top-left (0,0) — caught via a getBoundingClientRect check in a headless-Chromium diagnostic (rect x/y were 0 in a 1200-wide viewport; after the fix, x=360=(1200-480)/2). The :not(dialog) fallback keeps the div-overlay centering for engines without <dialog>.showModal().",
            "markdown": "`inset:0; margin:auto` is required on the native `<dialog>` because the app reset (`* { margin: 0 }`, _base.scss) zeroes the UA `margin: auto` that centers a modal dialog. Without it the dialog parked at the top-left (0,0) — caught via a getBoundingClientRect check in a headless-Chromium diagnostic (rect x/y were 0 in a 1200-wide viewport; after the fix, x=360=(1200-480)/2). The `:not(dialog)` fallback keeps the div-overlay centering for engines without <dialog>.showModal()."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "src/client/styles/_modal.scss"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 28,
                  "endLine": 28,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "  padding: 0;"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
